---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const title = 'B2B Supplier Sourcing for Buyers | Proof to Partner';
const description = 'Describe a real product, service or supplier requirement to Proof to Partner. Start with the scope, location, timing and criteria that matter.';
const breadcrumbs = [{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'For buyers', path: '/for-buyers/' }];
---
<SiteLayout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/for-buyers/" breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
<section class="section-space"><div class="container-shell grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.72fr] lg:items-center lg:gap-20"><div><p class="eyebrow">For buyers and decision-makers</p><h1 class="display-heading mt-6 max-w-3xl text-5xl font-semibold sm:text-6xl">Make the requirement clear before searching for the answer.</h1><p class="prose-copy mt-7 text-lg">A strong commercial requirement is more than “we need a supplier.” It explains what needs to be delivered, where, by when, and how suitability will be assessed. That is the foundation for useful research or an introduction.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row"><a class="btn-primary" href="/contact/?type=buyer">Submit a buyer requirement <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="btn-secondary" href="/how-it-works/">Understand the process</a></div></div><aside class="rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_20px_70px_-45px_rgba(19,40,59,0.3)] sm:p-8"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-brand-deep">A useful brief covers</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-4">{['The product, service or result you need','The location or geographic coverage','Target timing and any fixed deadlines','Quality, compliance or capability criteria','Budget range or commercial constraints, if shareable','What would make a conversation worthwhile'].map((item) => <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-soft"><span class="mt-0.5 grid size-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-mint text-xs font-bold text-brand-deep" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>{item}</li>)}</ul><p class="mt-6 border-t border-line pt-5 text-xs leading-5 text-muted">Share only information you are authorised to disclose. Do not include confidential terms, passwords or payment details.</p></aside></div></section>
<section class="border-y border-line bg-white py-16"><div class="container-shell"><p class="eyebrow">What happens next</p><div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="card-border p-6"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-brand">01 / Review</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold">Clarify the need</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">We aim to review the information and identify important questions before researching a possible path.</p></article><article class="card-border p-6"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-brand">02 / Assess</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold">Consider the fit</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">If the request is sufficiently clear and in scope, relevant counterparties may be researched against your criteria.</p></article><article class="card-border p-6"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-brand">03 / Discuss</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold">Agree a next step</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Any proposed introduction, fee or sharing of details is discussed before proceeding. There is no guarantee a match exists.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="container-shell py-16 sm:py-20"><div class="max-w-3xl"><h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">A note on fit and expectations</h2><p class="prose-copy mt-5">Proof to Partner is a developing, cross-industry connector business. It does not operate as an open marketplace and does not claim that a supplier is pre-approved, available or guaranteed to meet a requirement. You remain responsible for due diligence and final commercial decisions.</p><a class="mt-7 inline-flex font-semibold text-brand-deep underline underline-offset-4" href="/contact/?type=buyer">Start with your requirement →</a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>